    "q-108935": {
      "dom_id": "step-q108935",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Calculate $\\text{Var}[{k}^{2}]$ where $k$ is a constant.",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that for any constant $a,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[a]=0.\n$$\n\nTherefore, since $k$ is a constant, we have\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[{k}^{2}]=0.\n$$",
