      "problem": "Calculate $\\text{Var}[\\operatorname{ln}⁡c]$ where $c>0$ is a constant.",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that for any constant $a,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[a]=0.\n$$\n\nTherefore, since $c$ is a constant, we have\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[\\operatorname{ln}⁡c]=0.\n$$",
