      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Calculate $\\text{Var}[{c}^{4}-4c]$ where $c$ is a constant.",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that for any constant $a,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[a]=0.\n$$\n\nTherefore, since $c$ is a constant, we have\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[{c}^{4}-4c]=0.\n$$",
