    "q-129385": {
      "dom_id": "step-q129385",
      "name": "Question 10",
      "problem": "If $\\text{Var}[X]=100,$ calculate $\\text{Var}[0.5X].$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that for any random variable $X$ and constant $a,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[aX]={a}^{2}\\cdot \\text{Var}[X].\n$$\n\nIn our case, $a=0.5.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[0.5X] & ={0.5}^{2}\\cdot \\text{Var}[X] \\\\  & =0.25\\cdot 100 \\\\  & =25.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
